  title: "5. V\xD2NG L\u1EB6P C\u1EE6A GAME"
  body: "B\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa ch\u01A1i tr\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng nh\u1ECF:\n<b>Ch\u1EB7t ch\xE9m \u2192 Kh\xE1m ph\xE1 (theo m\u1EA9u gi\u1EA5y) \u2192 Nh\u1EADn \u0111\xE1 (n\u0103ng l\u1EF1c + h\u1ED3i m\xE0u) \u2192 Quay l\u1EA1i m\u1EDF l\u1ED1i c\u0169</b>\n\nV\xF2ng n\xE0y l\u1EB7p l\u1EA1i v\u1EDBi 2 vi\xEAn \u0111\xE1 n\u1EEFa, qu\xE1i m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n v\xE0 2 tr\u1EADn boss.\nNguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc: <b>m\xE0u s\u1EAFc = ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh = n\u0103ng l\u1EF1c</b>."
  width: 520
  isCheckpoint: 1
