  title: "1. \u0110\xC1NH TH\u01AF\u1EDCNG"
  body: "\u2022 <b>J</b>: ch\xE9m. B\u1EA5m J l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa ngay sau \u0111\xF3 = <b>combo 2 nh\u1ECBp</b> (1 + 1 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng).\n\u2022 <b>Gi\u1EEF J</b> ~0,6 s r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3: <b>\u0111\xF2n n\u1EB7ng</b> 3 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng, c\xF3 hit-stop + rung m\xE0n h\xECnh.\n\u2022 <b>K</b>: l\u0103n n\xE9 (c\xF3 kho\u1EA3nh kh\u1EAFc b\u1EA5t t\u1EED).\nTh\u1EED ch\xE9m c\xE1c kh\xFAc g\u1ED7 \u2013 ch\xFAng t\u1EF1 m\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i."
  width: 470
  isCheckpoint: 0
